			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 6, DX 14, IQ 1, HT 11, HP 12, WILL 10, PER 10, FP 12, SPEED 6.25, MOVE 12, DODGE 9, DR 4. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
